# Newsletter Sign-Up Form Implementation

Here's a complete, accessible, and responsive newsletter sign-up form you can drop into your site.

## HTML

```html
<form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter-form" novalidate>
  <h2 class="newsletter-form__title">Subscribe to our newsletter</h2>
  <p class="newsletter-form__subtitle">Get the latest news delivered to your inbox.</p>

  <div class="newsletter-form__field">
    <label for="newsletter-name" class="visually-hidden">Name (optional)</label>
    <input
      type="text"
      id="newsletter-name"
      name="name"
      placeholder="Your name (optional)"
      autocomplete="given-name"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="newsletter-form__field">
    <label for="newsletter-email" class="visually-hidden">Email address</label>
    <input
      type="email"
      id="newsletter-email"
      name="email"
      placeholder="you@example.com"
      autocomplete="email"
      required
      aria-required="true"
      aria-describedby="newsletter-error"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Honeypot (hidden from humans, catches bots) -->
  <div class="newsletter-form__hp" aria-hidden="true">
    <label for="newsletter-website">Leave this field empty</label>
    <input type="text" id="newsletter-website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
  </div>

  <button type="submit" class="newsletter-form__submit">Subscribe</button>

  <p id="newsletter-error" class="newsletter-form__error" role="alert" hidden></p>
  <p id="newsletter-success" class="newsletter-form__success" role="status" hidden></p>

  <p class="newsletter-form__privacy">
    We respect your privacy. Unsubscribe anytime.
  </p>
</form>
```

## CSS

```css
.newsletter-form {
  max-width: 420px;
  margin: 2rem auto;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #fff;
}

.newsletter-form__title {
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.newsletter-form__subtitle {
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
  color: #555;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}

.newsletter-form__field {
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.newsletter-form input[type="text"],
.newsletter-form input[type="email"] {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
  border: 1px solid #ccc;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 1rem;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  transition: border-color 0.15s;
}

.newsletter-form input:focus {
  outline: 2px solid #2563eb;
  outline-offset: 1px;
  border-color: #2563eb;
}

.newsletter-form input[aria-invalid="true"] {
  border-color: #dc2626;
}

.newsletter-form__submit {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 0.7rem;
  background: #2563eb;
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}

.newsletter-form__submit:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
.newsletter-form__submit:disabled { background: #93b3f0; cursor: not-allowed; }

.newsletter-form__error {
  color: #dc2626;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
}

.newsletter-form__success {
  color: #16a34a;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
}

.newsletter-form__privacy {
  margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: #777;
}

/* Honeypot hidden */
.newsletter-form__hp {
  position: absolute;
  left: -9999px;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Accessible-only label */
.visually-hidden {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}
```

## JavaScript (progressive enhancement)

```html
<script>
(function () {
  const form = document.getElementById('newsletter-form');
  if (!form) return;

  const emailInput = document.getElementById('newsletter-email');
  const errorEl = document.getElementById('newsletter-error');
  const successEl = document.getElementById('newsletter-success');
  const submitBtn = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');

  form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    errorEl.hidden = true;
    successEl.hidden = true;

    const email = emailInput.value.trim();
    const honeypot = form.website.value;

    // Bot trap
    if (honeypot) return;

    // Basic validation
    if (!email || !/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)) {
      emailInput.setAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');
      errorEl.textContent = 'Please enter a valid email address.';
      errorEl.hidden = false;
      emailInput.focus();
      return;
    }
    emailInput.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');

    submitBtn.disabled = true;
    submitBtn.textContent = 'Subscribing…';

    try {
      const res = await fetch('/api/newsletter/subscribe', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ email, name: form.name.value.trim() }),
      });

      if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Subscription failed');

      form.reset();
      successEl.textContent = 'Thanks! Please check your inbox to confirm.';
      successEl.hidden = false;
    } catch (err) {
      errorEl.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again later.';
      errorEl.hidden = false;
    } finally {
      submitBtn.disabled = false;
      submitBtn.textContent = 'Subscribe';
    }
  });
})();
</script>
```

## Backend endpoint (Node/Express example)

```js
import express from 'express';
const router = express.Router();

router.post('/api/newsletter/subscribe', express.json(), async (req, res) => {
  const { email, name } = req.body || {};

  if (!email || !/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: 'Invalid email' });
  }

  try {
    // TODO: persist to your DB / Mailchimp / ConvertKit / etc.
    // await db.subscribers.insert({ email, name, createdAt: new Date() });

    // Optional: send a double opt-in confirmation email here
    res.json({ ok: true });
  } catch (err) {
    console.error(err);
    res.status(500).json({ error: 'Server error' });
  }
});

export default router;
```

## Notes & recommendations

- **Double opt-in**: For GDPR/CAN-SPAM compliance, send a confirmation email before adding the subscriber to your list.
- **Rate limiting**: Protect the endpoint (e.g., `express-rate-limit`, 5 requests / IP / hour).
- **CAPTCHA** (optional): Add hCaptcha or Cloudflare Turnstile if you see bot traffic — the honeypot handles most of it.
- **Provider**: If you use Mailchimp, ConvertKit, Buttondown, or Resend, wire the backend to their API instead of a custom DB.
- **Analytics**: Fire an event on success (e.g., `gtag('event', 'newsletter_signup')`).

